# Environment & runtime credentials (never commit)
compose/.env
compose/.env.*
!compose/.env.example
compose/secrets/*
!compose/secrets/README.md
compose/backups/

# Generated operational & DR drill evidence reports
reports/*.json
reports/*.log
!reports/.gitkeep

